T*
(Factor:) Tj
T*
(- When factoring RoW land acquisition \(HVDC corridor is 40m wide vs 75m for HVAC\):) Tj
T*
(- Adjusted HVAC cost = Rs. 2.1 Crore/km; Adjusted HVDC cost = Rs. 1.25 Crore/km.) Tj
T*
(- Revised L_break = \(1,600 - 400\) / \(2.1 - 1.25\) = 1,200 / 0.85 = 1,411.76 km.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
